  "summary": "Permianville Royalty Trust operates as a statutory trust. It is involved in the acquisition and holding of net profits interest representing the right to receive 80% of the net profits from the sale of oil and natural gas production from properties located in the states of Texas, Louisiana, and New Mexico, as well as unconventional assets in the Permian and Haynesville basins. The company was formerly known as Enduro Royalty Trust and changed its name to Permianville Royalty Trust in September 2018. The company was incorporated in 2011 and is based in Houston, Texas.",
